  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENERGIA HIVOS 2016-17</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ENERGIA HIVOS 2016-17</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENERGIA is an international network on gender and sustainable energy and aims at mainstreaming gender into energy policy, decision making and practice.  ENERGIA was a program under ETC Foundation, the Netherlands. However it has changed to Hivos, NL In this assessment only risks R2-R6 have been assessed. Complete assessment in 13/000441. www.energia.org</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r sammanfattning av insatsen, se den ursprungligen gjorda beredningen i &#xe4;rende 13/000441. Givet att detta r&#xf6;r sig om en avtals&#xe4;ndring s&#xe5; har i f&#xf6;religgande bed&#xf6;mning, i enlighet med insatsregeln, endast den nya avtalspartnerns system f&#xf6;r intern styrning och kontroll bed&#xf6;mts, dvs riskerna R2-R6.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rka kvinnor och st&#xe4;rka gender mainstreaming i energipolicies, program och institutioner p&#xe5; internationell, regional och nationell niv&#xe5;.</narrative>
  </description>
